French#,#French#,#HASS Concentration in French#,#Concentration in French

A concentration in French requires three to four subjects at semester III or above.

french_lang, "French Language Subjects (Semester III+)" := 21G.303, 21G.304, 21G.306, 21G.307

french_culture, "French Culture and Literature" := 21G.049, 21G.050, 21G.051, 21G.052, 21G.053, 21G.054, 21G.061, 21G.068

all_french, "All French Concentration Courses" := french_lang / french_culture

total, "Three to Four French Subjects" := (all_french){>=3}

